	(text "Target power: VTGT = target supply out AND level-shifter reference in.\nSelf-powered target: leave TPWR_EN low, target drives VTGT, shifters follow it.\nProbe-powered target: firmware checks VTGT_SENSE ~0 V first, then sets TPWR_EN.\nQ1+Q2 back-to-back: no back-feed into 3V3/5V when off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 170.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1e757fdc-cff6-4905-976c-cc5de847fc30")
	)
	(text "Mode / channel map (firmware)\n1 SWD+UART (green): IO0 SWCLK, IO1 SWDIO, IO2 TX, IO3 RX, IO4 nRESET, IO5 SWO\n2 WCH (purple): CH32V003 SWIO on IO1; CH32V2xx/V3xx/X0 RVSWD IO1 data + IO0 clock; IO2 TX, IO3 RX; TPWR power cycle for unbrick\n3 UPDI (yellow): IO1 UPDI, IO2 TX, IO3 RX\n4 UART bridge (white): IO2 TX, IO3 RX, IO4 CTS, IO5 RTS; ESP32 auto-reset (esptool): host RTS -> IO4 (EN), host DTR -> IO5 (IO0/BOOT)\n5 Logic analyser (blue): IO0-IO7 = CH0-CH7\n6 SPI flash / serprog (orange): IO0 SCK, IO1 MOSI, IO2 MISO, IO3 CS\n7 JTAG (cyan): IO0 TCK, IO1 TMS, IO5 TDO, IO6 TDI, IO4 nSRST\n8 AVR ISP (red): IO0 SCK, IO1 MOSI, IO2 MISO, IO4 RESET"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.9 236.22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1f61ce30-a1df-418f-996b-1ed171127491")
	)
	(text "Channels (U2 A -> B, JPn bypass, Rn 33R -> connectors)\nIO0: SWCLK / RVSWD CLK / SPI SCK / TCK / ISP SCK / LA0\nIO1: SWDIO / SWIO / RVSWD DIO / UPDI / SPI MOSI / TMS / ISP MOSI / LA1\nIO2: UART TX / SPI MISO / ISP MISO / LA2\nIO3: UART RX / SPI CS / SWO alt / LA3\nIO4: nRESET / UART CTS / ESP32 EN / nSRST / ISP RESET / LA4\nIO5: SWO / UART RTS / ESP32 IO0 / TDO / LA5\nIO6: TDI / LA6\nIO7: LA7"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.9 76.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4813fea0-9fa0-4a7c-9683-7328b25a20bc")
	)
	(text "RP2040 pins\nGP2-GP9 = IO0-IO7 A side (contiguous for PIO / logic analyser)\nGP2/3/4/5 = SPI0 SCK/TX/RX/CSn, GP4/5/6/7 = UART1 TX/RX/CTS/RTS\nGP10 = SHIFT_OE (U2 OE, R14 pull-down; raise only once VTGT (ADC0 x 2) >= 3.1 V, i.e. ADC0 >= 1.55 V)\nGP14 = TPWR_EN (target power), GP26/ADC0 = VTGT_SENSE (VTGT/2)\nGP16 = WS2812 on module, BOOT button = mode\nFree: GP0, GP1, GP11, GP12, GP13, GP15, GP27, GP28, GP29"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 101.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ce30ccc8-b65a-4432-a7f3-d2001cff5484")
	)
